ent-WGAsfClothingUniformColonist = ASF work uniform
    .desc = Hard-wearing work fatigues with reflective bands, issued to ASF colonists.
ent-WGAsfClothingUniformResearcher = ASF field scrubs
    .desc = Purple scrubs for ASF researchers and medics. Easy to wash.
ent-WGAsfClothingUniformCasual = ASF off-duty uniform
    .desc = A purple jacket over dark trousers, for off-duty hours.
ent-WGAsfClothingUniformMedic = ASF medical whites
    .desc = Clean whites worn in ASF clinics.
ent-WGAsfClothingUniformFormal = ASF formal uniform
    .desc = A white dress shirt over purple trousers. Worn at receptions and treaty signings.
ent-WGAsfClothingUniformStarfleetJumpskirtBlack = ASF starfleet jumpskirt (black)
    .desc = A flowy ASF service uniform, designed for female members.
ent-WGAsfClothingUniformStarfleetJumpskirt = ASF starfleet jumpskirt
    .desc = A flowy ASF service uniform, designed for female members.
ent-WGAsfClothingHeadBeretPlumed = ASF plumed beret
    .desc = A purple beret with a long white plume. Part of an ASF envoy's dress uniform.
ent-WGAsfClothingHeadCap = ASF peaked cap
    .desc = A dark peaked cap with a gold band, worn by ASF officers.
ent-WGAsfClothingHeadHat = ASF brimmed hat
    .desc = A dark brimmed hat. Popular with envoys who don't want to be saluted.
ent-WGAsfClothingHeadConductorCap = ASF conductor cap
    .desc = A comfortable visored hat bearing the gilded insignia of the Federation.
ent-WGAsfClothingNeckCapelet = ASF capelet
    .desc = A short purple capelet with gold trim, worn on formal occasions.
ent-WGAsfClothingNeckCape = ASF envoy cape
    .desc = A long dark cape lined in purple and gold. Reserved for ASF envoys.
ent-WGAsfClothingNeckShroudEnvoy = ASF envoy shroud
    .desc = A dark shroud lined in purple and gold. Reserved for ASF envoys.
ent-WGAsfClothingNeckShroudResearcher = ASF researcher shroud
    .desc = A shroud lined in purple and gold. For researchers carrying the Federation's insignia.
ent-WGAsfClothingOuterParade = ASF parade jacket
    .desc = A dark dress jacket with gold braid and purple piping.
ent-WGAsfClothingOuterRobe = ASF council robe
    .desc = A long dark robe with a purple stole, worn by members of the Federation council.
ent-WGAsfClothingOuterExplorerLabcoat = ASF explorer labcoat
    .desc = A thin labcoat for the casually minded. It bears the Federation's insignia on its back, and you can wear it around your waist.
ent-WGAsfClothingOuterHaori = ASF haori
    .desc = A traditional japanese jacket in the Federation's colors.
ent-WGAsfClothingOuterEVA = ASF EVA suit
    .desc = A basic ASF EVA suit. Keeps you breathing outside the hull and not much else.
ent-WGAsfClothingHeadEVA = ASF EVA helmet
    .desc = A basic ASF EVA helmet with a wide visor.
ent-WGAsfClothingShoesBoots = ASF boots
    .desc = Standard-issue ASF service boots.
ent-WGAsfClothingHandsGloves = ASF gloves
    .desc = Dark gloves issued with the ASF service uniform.
ent-WGAsfClothingBackpack = ASF backpack
    .desc = A grey backpack with purple straps, standard issue for ASF personnel.
ent-WGAsfClothingBackpackSatchel = ASF satchel
    .desc = A dark ASF satchel with a purple clasp.
ent-WGAsfClothingBackpackDuffel = ASF duffel bag
    .desc = A large grey ASF duffel bag with a purple strap.

